{"unit_id": "tag:02W1:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面研究概形（schemes）相对于 fpqc 覆盖（covering）的下降（descent）数据（data）是否有效（effective）。首先要指出，这并不总是成立。我们将在代数空间（Algebraic Spaces）例<REF_0001>中看到这一点。即使射影（projective）态射（morphisms）也并非总是满足 fpqc 覆盖（coverings）的下降（descent），见例子（Examples）引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一方面，若试图下降（descend）的概形（schemes）特别简单，则有时整类（classes）概形（schemes）的下降（descent）数据（data）都是有效（effective）的。这里将引入抽象描述这种现象的术语，尽管以后使用不当可能引起混淆。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "Examples", "target_term": "例子"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "classes", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形下降，待决"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "fpqc 覆盖，待决"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "概形的下降，待决"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据，待决"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效", "context": "下降数据的有效性，待决"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "引用章节，待决"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "态射的射影性，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"