{"unit_id": "tag:02W2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是底（base）上的概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的一种性质。设<MATH_0002>。我们称<TEXTITOPEN_0001>类型为（morphisms of type）<MATH_0003>的态射满足下降（satisfy descent for），相对于<MATH_0004>覆盖（coverings）而言<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对于任意<MATH_0005>覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>（见拓扑（Topologies）第<REF_0001>节），任意下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0007>，其相对于<MATH_0008>，且每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>都具有性质<MATH_0010>，都是有效（effective）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "底"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms of type", "target_term": "类型为"}, {"source_term": "satisfy descent for", "target_term": "满足下降"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "底", "context": "概形态射的底，待决"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底上的概形，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "底上的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphisms of type", "target_term": "类型为", "context": "指定类型的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "satisfy descent for", "target_term": "满足下降", "context": "相对于指定覆盖的下降性质，待决"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "定义中的覆盖类，待决"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "任意所选覆盖，待决"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章节，待决"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据，待决"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "给定下降数据，待决"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "各局部对象的态射，待决"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效", "co