{"unit_id": "tag:02W1:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，在每种情形下，我们已经证明从<MATH_0001>上的概形（schemes）到<MATH_0002>上的下降（descent）数据（data）的函子（functor）是完全忠实（fully faithful）的（将引理<REF_0001>与拓扑（Topologies）中的结果结合：任意<MATH_0003>覆盖（covering）也是 fpqc 覆盖（covering））。还已证明，相对于 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）的下降（descent）数据（data）总是有效（effective）的（引理<REF_0002>）。审慎的做法或许是仅当<MATH_0004>在任意基变换（base change）下稳定，或至少在<MATH_0005>拓扑（topology）中关于底（base）是局部（local）的（见定义<REF_0003>）时，才研究刚引入的概念，以避免错误论证（在下降（descending）进行到一半时依赖<MATH_0006>）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面给出必需的引理，将此问题归结到由仿射概形（affines）的单个态射（morphism）给出的覆盖（covering）的情形。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc", "Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "底"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "descending", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底上的概形，待决"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据，待决"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据复数，待决"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "概形到下降数据的函子，待决"}, {"source_term": "fully