{"unit_id": "tag:02W3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是底（base）上的概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的一种性质。设<MATH_0002>。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>在任意基变换（base change）下稳定（见概形（Schemes）定义<REF_0001>），\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>，具有<MATH_0006>，则<MATH_0007>也具有此性质，并且\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>，它是平坦（flat）的、平坦（flat）且有限表现（finite presentation）的、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的、光滑（smooth）的或合成（syntomic）的，具体取决于<MATH_0009>是 fpqc、fppf、平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）、光滑（smooth）或合成（syntomic），任意下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0010>，其相对于<MATH_0011>、底为<MATH_0012>，且<MATH_0013>对<MATH_0014>成立，都是有效（effective）的。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则类型为<MATH_0015>的态射（morphisms）满足<MATH_0016>覆盖（coverings）的下降（descent）。\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc", "fppf"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "base", "target_term": "底"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affines", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表现"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "syntomic", "target_term": "合成"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "base", "t